  "hintHomeTitle": "How to Journey on Home",
  "hintHomeDesc": "[Steps & Timeline Progression]\nWith every step counting as 1 day in the app, your journey advances from ancient times—1,000,000 days before the date you started the app—toward the modern era.\nSteps sync automatically in the background even when the app is closed.\n\n[Eras & Scenery]\n• Tap the top date button to read in-depth historical context and image titles for your current era.\n• Every 10 years, you reach a new era and the background scenery automatically updates.\n• Centuries advance every 100 years. At milestone centuries, an in-app review prompt or an ad may appear.\n\n[Collecting Artifacts]\n• Bottom-Right ★ Button: Watch a short video ad to discover an uncollected artifact (technology, historical figure, or event) from your current era (available roughly once every 4 hours).\n• Daily Step Milestones: You also earn an artifact when you walk 6,000+ and 10,000+ steps in a day and open the app on that same day.",
  "hintHistoryTitle": "How to View History",
  "hintHistoryDesc": "[Eras & Artifacts]\nThe \"Eras\" you have reached and the \"Artifacts\" you have discovered during your journey are organized and recorded century by century.\n\n[Viewing Details]\n• Tap each century panel to expand and view the list of items.\n• Tap any item to view its details.\n\n[Difference from Hall of Fame]\n• This app supports multiple playthroughs (rounds). This History screen displays only the \"Eras\" and \"Artifacts\" unlocked in your current round.\n• The \"Hall of Fame\" in the side menu displays all \"Eras\" and \"Artifacts\" collected across all your rounds so far.",
  "tabSteps": "Steps",
  "homeDefaultDescription": "Around 750 BCE, maritime trade by Phoenicians flourished in the Mediterranean, while Etruscan culture began developing in the Italian Peninsula.",
